{"id":"ale_m","lemma":"além","pos":"adv","rank":340,"glosses":["there, over there","beyond (farther along or away)"],"ipa":"/aˈlɐ̃j̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a1/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-al%C3%A9m.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-al%C3%A9m.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Além disso, há outras razões.","en":"In addition to this, there are other reasons.","words":[null,{"g":"of that"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"other one","l":"outro"},{"g":"reason","l":"razão"}]},{"text":"Não foi nada além de coincidência.","en":"It was nothing but coincidence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/769854","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"coincidence"}]},{"text":"Não temos alternativa além de trabalhar.","en":"We have no alternative but to work.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"alternative"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to work"}]},{"text":"Não podemos fazer nada além disso.","en":"That's all we can do.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to create"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"of that"}]},{"text":"Será que não existe nada além disso?","en":"Can this be all there is?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to exist","l":"existir"},{"g":"nothing"},null,{"g":"of that"}]}]}